inter Lemons","overview":"Pietro and Eleonora, both avid gardeners, are strangers who only meet because their two terraces are close to each other. The relationship that grows between them helps them to alleviate the pain each feels over something secret and very serious, a pain both try to hide from themselves and those around them. In this limbo they inhabit, the two make a stab at finding happiness together, until their paths diverge once more."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iLvQi7xNomIf2Kyb7Z8P2qqCMmS.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iLvQi7xNomIf2Kyb7Z8P2qqCMmS.png","language":"it","width":2086,"height":573}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/32jzdFfVwzHGwjqNWnfnUzF6iAC.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/32jzdFfVwzHGwjqNWnfnUzF6iAC.jpg","language":"it","width":791,"height":1186},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nQn5ZwTdovuh58GfGIXuPQ2TRwL.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nQn5ZwTdovuh58GfGIXuPQ2TRwL.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500}],"backdrops":[{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vgG4nNL9uxOXk6dlBkLADf6irLj.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vgG4nNL9uxOXk6dlBkLADf6irLj.jpg","language":"it","width":1920,"height":1080},{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/klw6b8aNAcdGqsb7kmkUo3QOBny.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/klw6b8aNAcdGqsb7kmkUo3QOBny.jpg","language":"xx","width":1280,"height":720},{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4ct8f6erygZ866AZy2LMeLSKrbl.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4ct8f6erygZ866AZy2LMeLSKrbl.jpg","language":"xx","width":1423,"height":800},{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w1O7uKxZFF0F82vQqLudrGUfsGW.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/w1O7uKxZFF0F82vQqLudrGUfsGW.jpg","language":"xx","width":1423,"